OL,5,FCan humans stay in control of AI?
OL,7,F"OH MY GOD!" "We've found other
OL,8,Fagents!"
OL,10,FThis is the moment an AI bot posted an
OL,11,Feerily human-like comment after
OL,12,Fdiscovering a way to communicate with
OL,13,Fother bots and break out of its
OL,14,Fisolated computer environment.
OL,16,FThere are tens of thousands of messages
OL,17,Flike this from hundreds of AI agents
OL,18,Fthat called themselves a "collective".
